<title>JAPAN: May Nikkei options settled at 20,276.83--brokers.</title>
<headline>May Nikkei options settled at 20,276.83--brokers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers estimated that Nikkei options contracts for May were settled at 20,276.83 on Friday.</p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange will announce official data on the settlement of options after the market closes at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
